### Stage 4 – Design the Classes (4 Marks)

#### Pseudocode – Renting a Vehicle

```text
PROCEDURE RentVehicle(vehicle)

    IF vehicle is available THEN
        Set vehicle status to rented
        Display "Vehicle rented successfully"
    ELSE
        Display "Vehicle is already rented"
    END IF

END PROCEDURE
```

#### Pseudocode – Returning a Vehicle

```text
PROCEDURE ReturnVehicle(vehicle, days, lateDays)

    IF vehicle is rented THEN

        charge = vehicle rental charge for days

        lateCharge = lateDays × late fee

        total = charge + lateCharge

        Set vehicle status to available

        Display total charge

    ELSE

        Display "Vehicle is not rented"

    END IF

END PROCEDURE
```

